    <briefdescription>
<para>Registry of Shadertoy pass file names — deterministic discovery. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Nested inside <ref refid="structconfig_1_1_file" kindref="compound">File</ref>. CRTP-derived from <ref refid="classjam_1_1Map_1_1Instance" kindref="compound" external="/Users/jreng/Documents/Poems/dev/jam/docs/tagfile.xml">jam::Map::Instance&lt;Shaders&gt;</ref>.</para>
<para>Maps each enum key to its Identifier stem which IS the on-disk filename (no extension — Shadertoy convention). The filesystem is the manifest: present files are loaded, absent files are skipped.</para>
<para>Owns the shaders root directory path. The live instance is owned by <ref refid="classend_1_1_application" kindref="compound">end::Application</ref> — static <ref refid="structconfig_1_1_file_1_1_shaders_1aa57d90d95ec92f5c3e46b80b84f3bf6a" kindref="member">get()</ref> resolves through Context&lt;Shaders&gt;. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
